  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In an effort to reduce the learning curve associated with developing in the fedora repository baseline by adopting a standardized application source structure and leveraging community plug-ins, this suggested improvement is to migrate from the existing ANT build framework to Maven2.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task includes:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ":restructuring the source tree(s)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ":moving dependency management into a pom.xml",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ":associating plug-in for eclipse .classpath/.project generation",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ":migrating test suites to Maven2 framework",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ":...",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
